  'Check whether the successor can start without asking anyone; flag contacts listed by name only': '检查接手人能否不问人就开始；有没有只写人名不写负责什么',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver a handover the successor can work from on day one': '合同达标后交付一份接手人第一天就能照着干的交接文档',
  'Let the successor pick up everything in flight without verbal briefing': '让接手人不靠口头交代就能接住所有进行中的事',
  'The successor and the shared manager': '接手的同事和共同主管',
  'Sections: Scope of responsibility, Work in flight and status, Key contacts and resources, Gotchas; each item has status and next step; contacts say what they own; gotchas have symptom and workaround; access handover is not omitted': '负责范围、进行中的事项与状态、关键联系人与资源、注意事项与坑各有一节；每个事项有状态与下一步；联系人写负责什么；坑有现象与绕法；不遗漏权限交接',
  'Milestone report': '里程碑汇报',
  'Milestone attainment, acceptance evidence and leftovers': '里程碑达成情况、验收证据和余留',
  '## Milestone definition\n\n## Attainment and evidence\n\n## Leftovers\n\n## Next milestone': '## 里程碑定义\n\n## 达成情况与证据\n\n## 余留问题\n\n## 下一里程碑',
  'Pull the original acceptance criteria and the matching deliverables, tests and demo records': '取里程碑的原始验收标准和对应的交付物、测试、演示记录',
  'Per acceptance criterion write attainment and the evidence link; leftovers state impact and plan; the next milestone states its bar and date': '逐条验收标准写达成与证据链接；余留写影响和处理计划；下一里程碑写标准与日期',
  'Check each criterion has a verdict, evidence links open, and leftovers are not counted as done': '检查每条标准都有判定、证据可打开、余留没有被算成达成',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver a milestone report reviewers can tick line by line': '合同达标后交付一份评审人能逐条勾的里程碑汇报',
  'Prove the milestone against its acceptance criteria and account for leftovers': '对照验收标准证明里程碑达成并交代余留',
  'Project reviewers and sponsor': '项目评审人和赞助人',
  'Sections: Milestone definition, Attainment and evidence, Leftovers, Next milestone; each criterion has a verdict and evidence; leftovers are listed separately, not counted as done; the next milestone has a bar and date': '里程碑定义、达成情况与证据、余留问题、下一里程碑各有一节；每条验收标准有判定与证据；余留单列不算达成；下一里程碑有标准与日期',
  '1:1 notes': '一对一记录',
  'The other person\'s update, concerns and what you agreed': '对方的近况、顾虑和双方的约定',
  '## Their update\n\n## Concerns and support needed\n\n## Feedback and discussion\n\n## What we agreed': '## 对方的近况\n\n## 顾虑与需要的支持\n\n## 反馈与讨论\n\n## 双方约定',
  'Take only this conversation\'s notes and last time\'s agreements, to check follow-through': '只取这次谈话的记录和上次一对一的约定，用来核对跟进',
  'Write updates and concerns in the other person\'s words without concluding for them; feedback cites specific examples; agreements say who does what by when': '近况和顾虑用对方的话写、不替对方下结论；反馈写具体事例；约定写谁在何时做什么',
  'Check no concern is recorded as resolved when it was not, and agreements have actions on both sides': '检查有没有把对方的顾虑写成已解决、约定是否双方都有动作',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver notes you can open and check against at the next 1:1': '合同达标后交付一份下次一对一能直接翻开对照的记录',
  'Capture what the other person actually cares about and what both sides agreed': '记下这次一对一里对方真正在意的事和双方的约定',
  'Yourself and the person you met': '自己和一对一的对方',
  'Sections: Their update, Concerns and support needed, Feedback and discussion, What we agreed; concerns in their words; agreements have owner and time; discussion is not written as conclusions; last time\'s agreements have outcomes': '对方的近况、顾虑与需要的支持、反馈与讨论、双方约定各有一节；顾虑用对方原话；约定有人与时间；不把讨论写成结论；上次约定有跟进结果',
  'Decision record': '决策记录',
  'What was decided, why, and what was rejected': '决定了什么、为什么、放弃了什么',
  '## The question\n\n## Options considered\n\n## Decision and rationale\n\n## Consequences and review date': '## 要决定的问题\n\n## 备选方案\n\n## 决定与理由\n\n## 后果与复核时间',
  'Pull the discussion record, data and existing constraints; find the original pro and con views for every option': '取讨论记录、数据和既有约束，每个备选都要找到支持与反对的原始意见',
  'State the question as one answerable sentence; options list pros and cons; the decision names who decided and why; consequences state the accepted cost and the review date': '问题写成一句可回答的话；备选逐条写优缺点；决定写拍板人与理由；后果写接受了什么代价与何时复核',
  'Check rejected options have reasons, the decision traces to a decider, and leanings are not written as decided': '检查被放弃的方案有理由、决定能追到拍板人、没有把倾向写成已决',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver a record that still explains the decision six months from now': '合同达标后交付一份半年后仍能解释为什么这么定的记录',
  'Pin down a decision with its options and reasons so it is not reopened later': '把一个决定连同备选和理由固定下来，避免日后反复',
  'Teams affected by the decision and your future self': '受决定影响的团队和未来的自己',
  'Sections: The question, Options considered, Decision and rationale, Consequences and review date; the question is one answerable sentence; each option has pros and cons; the decision has a decider and rationale; a review date exists': '要决定的问题、备选方案、决定与理由、后果与复核时间各有一节；问题是一句可回答的话；每个备选有优缺点；决定有拍板人与理由；有复核日期',
  'Interview debrief': '面试反馈',
  'Evidence, ratings and hire recommendation': '证据、评分和录用建议',
  '## Dimensions and evidence\n\n## Strengths\n\n## Concerns\n\n## Recommendation and why': '## 考察维度与证据\n\n## 亮点\n\n## 顾虑\n\n## 建议与理由',
  'Use only this interview\'s questions, the candidate\'s answers and exercise results; do not reference other interviewers\' verdicts': '只取本场面试的提问、候选人回答和作业结果，不参考其他面试官的结论',
  'Per dimension write the question, answer highlights and judgment; strengths and concerns cite words or behaviour; the recommendation uses an explicit hire level with reasons': '每个维度写问题、回答要点和判断；亮点与顾虑各举原话或行为；建议用明确的录用等级并说明理由',
  'Check judgments have answer evidence, no appearance or background bias, and the recommendation matches the evidence': '检查判断都有回答证据、没有外貌或背景偏见、建议与证据一致',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver a debrief the hiring committee can judge from independently': '合同达标后交付一份面试委员会能据此独立判断的反馈',
  'Lay out the evidence and judgment from this interview for the hiring decision': '把本场面试的证据和判断写清，供招聘决策使用',
