  'Sections: Dimensions and evidence, Strengths, Concerns, Recommendation and why; each dimension has evidence; strengths and concerns cite words or behaviour; the recommendation has an explicit level and reasons; no biased statements': '考察维度与证据、亮点、顾虑、建议与理由各有一节；每个维度有证据；亮点与顾虑有原话或行为；建议有明确等级与理由；无偏见表述',
  'Customer call notes': '客户访谈纪要',
  'Verbatim quotes, pains, asks and follow-ups': '客户原话、痛点、需求和跟进',
  '## Customer context\n\n## Pains and quotes\n\n## Asks and expectations\n\n## Follow-ups': '## 客户背景\n\n## 痛点与原话\n\n## 需求与期待\n\n## 跟进事项',
  'Use this call transcript as the primary source and keep verbatim quotes; add only verifiable public facts for company context': '以本次通话转写为主，保留客户原话；公司背景只补可核实的公开信息',
  'Pair each pain with a verbatim quote; separate what the customer said from what we infer; follow-ups name our owner and date': '痛点配一句客户原话；需求区分客户明说的和我们推断的；跟进写我方负责人与时间',
  'Check inferences are not attributed to the customer, promises stay within authority, and follow-ups have owners': '检查有没有把推断写成客户说的、承诺是否超出授权、跟进有没有人',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver call notes both sales and product can use directly': '合同达标后交付一份销售和产品都能直接用的访谈纪要',
  'Faithfully record what the customer said and wants, and what we do next': '忠实记录客户说了什么、要什么，以及我们接下来做什么',
  'Account owner, product and sales teams': '客户负责人、产品与销售团队',
  'Sections: Customer context, Pains and quotes, Asks and expectations, Follow-ups; pains have verbatim quotes; stated and inferred are separate; each follow-up has an owner and date; no unauthorised promises': '客户背景、痛点与原话、需求与期待、跟进事项各有一节；痛点有客户原话；明说与推断分开；每个跟进有负责人与时间；不写未经授权的承诺',
  'Board update': '董事会更新',
  'Key metrics, major progress and asks of the board': '关键指标、重大进展和需要董事会的事',
  '## One-page summary\n\n## Key metrics\n\n## Major progress and risks\n\n## Asks of the board': '## 一页摘要\n\n## 关键指标\n\n## 重大进展与风险\n\n## 需要董事会的事',
  'Pull the latest core financial and business metrics with prior-period comparison; major items follow formal records': '取财务与业务核心指标的最新数据与上期对比，重大事项以正式记录为准',
  'The summary leads with conclusions; metrics show current, prior and target; risks state likelihood, impact and response; asks are specific requests': '摘要先说结论；指标写本期、上期与目标；风险写概率、影响与应对；需要的事写成具体请求',
