  'Collect every idea from whiteboard, stickies and transcript without filtering; keep who proposed it': '取白板、便签和讨论转写里的所有想法，不提前过滤；保留提出者',
  'One sentence per idea, no judgment; cluster by theme not by person; standouts say why worth a look; next steps describe how to validate, not adopt': '想法一条一句、不评价；聚类按主题而非按人；亮点写为什么值得看；下一步写验证方法而非直接采纳',
  'Check unpopular ideas were not dropped and clustering did not sneak in a decision': '检查有没有漏掉冷门想法、聚类有没有偷偷做决定',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver notes someone who missed the session can build on': '合同达标后交付一份让没参加的人也能接着想的记录',
  'Preserve every brainstorm idea and sort out directions worth validating': '完整保留头脑风暴的想法并整理出值得验证的方向',
  'Participants and whoever screens the ideas next': '参与者和后续负责筛选的人',
  'Sections: Problem statement, All ideas, Clusters and standouts, Next to validate; Problem in one sentence; ideas uncut and unjudged; clusters are not decisions; next steps are validation methods': '问题陈述、所有想法、聚类与亮点、下一步要验证的各有一节；问题一句话；想法不评价不删减；聚类不等于决定；下一步是验证方法',
  'Workshop summary': '工作坊总结',
  'Goal, outputs, agreements and disagreements': '目标、产出、共识与分歧',
  '## Workshop goal\n\n## Main outputs\n\n## Agreements\n\n## Disagreements and next steps': '## 工作坊目标\n\n## 主要产出\n\n## 达成的共识\n\n## 分歧与后续',
  'Pull the agenda, each exercise\'s outputs and the closing vote or synthesis': '取议程、各环节产出物和结束时的投票或归纳记录',
  'Outputs follow the exercises with references to the originals; agreements say how they formed; disagreements present both sides without ruling; next steps have owners and dates': '产出按环节写并附原物引用；共识写明怎么形成的；分歧两边都写、不裁决；后续有人与时间',
  'Check disagreements were not recorded as consensus and outputs map to the goal': '检查分歧有没有被写成共识、产出是否对应目标',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver a summary every participant would endorse': '合同达标后交付一份所有参与者都认可的工作坊总结',
  'Faithfully summarise the workshop\'s outputs, agreements and open disagreements': '如实总结工作坊的产出、共识与未解分歧',
  'Participants and their teams': '参与者和他们的团队',
  'Sections: Workshop goal, Main outputs, Agreements, Disagreements and next steps; outputs map to the goal; agreements state how they formed; disagreements show both sides; next steps have owners and dates': '工作坊目标、主要产出、达成的共识、分歧与后续各有一节；产出对应目标；共识写形成过程；分歧两边都写；后续有人与时间',
  'Project kickoff': '项目启动会',
  'Goal, scope, roles and ways of working': '目标、范围、角色和工作方式',
  '## Goal and success criteria\n\n## In and out of scope\n\n## Roles and responsibilities\n\n## Ways of working and cadence': '## 项目目标与成功标准\n\n## 范围内外\n\n## 角色与职责\n\n## 工作方式与节奏',
  'Pull the charter, stakeholder list and kickoff discussion; scope follows what was confirmed in the meeting': '取立项文档、干系人名单和启动会讨论记录；范围以会上确认的为准',
  'Success criteria are measurable; out-of-scope items are listed explicitly; each role has one owner; cadence covers meetings, reporting and how decisions get made': '成功标准可度量；范围外明确列出；每个角色一个负责人；节奏写会议、汇报与决策方式',
  'Check out-of-scope is not empty, no role lacks an owner, and success criteria are measurable': '检查范围外是否为空、有没有角色没人、成功标准能否度量',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver the first document a new member reads when joining': '合同达标后交付一份新成员加入时第一份要读的项目说明',
  'Set out the project\'s goal, boundaries, roles and cadence in one place': '把项目的目标、边界、角色和节奏一次说清',
  'Project members and stakeholders': '项目成员和干系人',
  'Sections: Goal and success criteria, In and out of scope, Roles and responsibilities, Ways of working and cadence; success criteria measurable; out-of-scope non-empty; every role has an owner; ways of working state the decision path': '项目目标与成功标准、范围内外、角色与职责、工作方式与节奏各有一节；成功标准可度量；范围外非空；每个角色有负责人；工作方式写清决策路径',
  'Cross-team sync': '跨团队同步',
  'Each side\'s progress, dependencies and interface agreements': '各方进展、依赖和接口约定',
  '## Progress per team\n\n## Dependencies and blockers\n\n## Interfaces and agreements\n\n## Before next sync': '## 各方进展\n\n## 相互依赖与阻塞\n\n## 接口与约定\n\n## 下次同步前要做的',
  'Pull each team\'s progress and existing interface docs; dependencies count only when both sides confirm': '取各团队带来的进展记录和既有接口文档，依赖以双方都确认的为准',
  'Progress is blocked per team; dependencies say who waits on whom for what and until when; agreements state what changed; to-dos have owners and dates': '进展按团队分块；依赖写谁等谁、等什么、到何时；约定写变更了什么；待办有人与时间',
  'Check dependencies are acknowledged by both sides and interface changes reached the affected parties': '检查依赖是否双方都认、约定变更有没有通知到受影响方',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver sync notes every team can reconcile against': '合同达标后交付一份各团队都能直接拿去对账的同步纪要',
  'Align progress, dependencies and interface agreements across teams': '对齐各团队的进展、依赖和接口约定',
  'Team leads and interface owners': '各团队负责人与接口对接人',
