  'PRD': '产品需求文档',
  'Problem, target users, solution and success metrics': '问题、目标用户、方案与成功指标',
  '## Problem\n\n## Target users and scenarios\n\n## Solution and scope\n\n## Success metrics\n\n## Risks and open questions': '## 要解决的问题\n\n## 目标用户与场景\n\n## 方案与范围\n\n## 成功指标\n\n## 风险与未决问题',
  'Pull verbatim user feedback, data and prior decisions; separate what users said, what we observed and what we infer': '取用户反馈原话、数据和既有决定；区分用户说的、我们观察到的和我们推断的',
  'State the problem in one sentence from the user\'s view; each solution item is acceptable; out-of-scope is explicit; metrics have definitions and baselines; risks and assumptions are listed apart': '问题写成用户视角的一句话；方案逐条可验收；范围外明确；指标带口径与基线；风险与假设分开列',
  'Check requirements are acceptable, metrics measurable, and wishes are not written as validated': '检查需求能否验收、指标能否度量、有没有把愿望写成已验证',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver a PRD design and engineering can estimate and start from': '合同达标后交付一份设计和工程能据此估算与开工的 PRD',
  'Write a product requirement to the point it can be reviewed, estimated and accepted': '把一个产品需求写到能被评审、估算和验收',
  'Design, engineering and product reviewers': '设计、工程与产品评审人',
  'Sections: Problem, Target users and scenarios, Solution and scope, Success metrics, Risks and open questions; problem in one user-view sentence; each requirement acceptable; metrics have definitions and baselines; out-of-scope explicit; assumptions flagged': '要解决的问题、目标用户与场景、方案与范围、成功指标、风险与未决问题各有一节；问题是用户视角一句话；每条需求可验收；指标有口径与基线；范围外明确；假设被标明',
  'Feature spec': '功能规格',
  'Behaviour, edge cases and acceptance for one feature': '单个功能的行为、边界和验收',
  '## Overview\n\n## User flow and behaviour\n\n## Edge cases and errors\n\n## Acceptance criteria': '## 功能概述\n\n## 用户流程与行为\n\n## 边界与异常\n\n## 验收标准',
  'Pull the matching PRD section, design mocks and current behaviour records; edge cases follow real system limits': '取对应的 PRD 段落、设计稿和现有行为记录；边界以实际系统限制为准',
  'The flow lists the system response per step; each edge case states trigger and expectation; acceptance criteria are tickable sentences': '流程按步骤写系统响应；每个边界写触发条件与期望；验收写成可逐条勾的句子',
  'Check every error has an expected behaviour and acceptance covers all flow branches': '检查异常是否有期望行为、验收是否覆盖所有流程分支',
  'Once the contract is met, deliver a spec engineering and QA can implement and verify against': '合同达标后交付一份工程和测试能对照实现与验证的规格',
