  'Pull the configuration, raw data and run logs; results follow recorded values, never memory': '取实验配置、原始数据、运行日志；结果以记录的数值为准，不凭记忆补',
  'The hypothesis is falsifiable; setup is reproducible (versions, parameters, data); results carry values and uncertainty; conclusions claim only what data supports': '假设写成可被证伪的句子；设置写到能复现（版本、参数、数据）；结果写数值与不确定度；结论只说数据支持的',
