  'Per goal state attainment and evidence; strengths and growth areas each cite two concrete events; expectations are observable behaviours, not personality asks; the tone invites conversation': '逐目标写达成与证据；优点与成长点各举两件具体事；期待写成可观察的行为而非性格要求；语气可对话',
